<style>
  .be-page { --be-ink:#18211c; --be-forest:#233b30; --be-moss:#64755e; --be-gold:#c8a96e; --be-paper:#f5f1e8; --be-line:rgba(35,59,48,.16); background:#fbfaf6; color:var(--be-ink); }
  .be-page a { color:inherit; }
  .be-hero { min-height:680px; position:relative; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; overflow:hidden; background:#18211c; border-radius:0 0 34px 34px; }
  .be-hero-media,.be-hero-media picture,.be-hero-media img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; }
  .be-hero-media img { object-fit:cover; object-position:center 58%; }
  .be-hero::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,20,16,.2) 0%,rgba(12,20,16,.28) 36%,rgba(12,20,16,.92) 100%); }
  .be-hero-inner { width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px)); margin:0 auto; padding:120px 0 72px; position:relative; z-index:1; color:#fff; }
  .be-breadcrumb { display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:54px; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.08em; color:rgba(255,255,255,.68); }
  .be-breadcrumb a { text-decoration:none; }
  .be-breadcrumb a:hover { color:#fff; }
  .be-eyebrow { color:#e7c98f; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.2em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .be-hero h1 { max-width:850px; font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,94px); line-height:.98; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-.035em; margin:0 0 24px; }
  .be-hero-deck { max-width:720px; font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,22px); line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,255,255,.84); font-weight:300; }
  .be-stat-row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1px; margin-top:40px; }
  .be-stat { min-width:145px; padding:16px 24px 14px; border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); }
  .be-stat strong { display:block; font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:30px; font-weight:500; color:#fff; }
  .be-stat span { display:block; margin-top:3px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.62); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .be-section { width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px)); margin:0 auto; padding:96px 0; }
  .be-section + .be-section { border-top:0; }
  .be-kicker { color:#8a7143; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.19em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .be-section-head { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.72fr) minmax(420px,1.28fr); gap:80px; align-items:start; margin-bottom:54px; }
  .be-section h2 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:clamp(34px,4.2vw,58px); line-height:1.08; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-.025em; color:var(--be-forest); }
  .be-lead { font-size:18px; line-height:1.9; color:#4e5a52; }
  .be-context-links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:25px; }
  .be-context-links a { border-bottom:1px solid #a88950; color:#6d572f; padding:3px 0; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; }
  .be-fit-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; }
  .be-fit-card { position:relative; overflow:hidden; background:var(--be-paper); padding:38px 34px 40px; min-height:220px; border-radius:20px; box-shadow:0 14px 42px rgba(24,33,28,.055); }
  .be-fit-card::before { content:""; position:absolute; left:34px; top:0; width:42px; height:3px; border-radius:0 0 3px 3px; background:var(--be-gold); }
  .be-fit-card .be-num { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; color:#a18452; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:34px; }
  .be-fit-card h3 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:23px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--be-forest); }
  .be-fit-card p { font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#59635c; }
  .be-visual-story { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.06fr .88fr 1.06fr; gap:18px; margin-top:58px; }
  .be-visual-scene { position:relative; min-height:430px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:24px; background:#d8d5ca; box-shadow:0 22px 56px rgba(24,33,28,.08); }
  .be-visual-scene:nth-child(2) { margin-top:42px; }
  .be-visual-scene picture,.be-visual-scene img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; }
  .be-visual-scene img { object-fit:cover; transition:transform .8s ease; }
  .be-visual-scene:hover img { transform:scale(1.025); }
  .be-visual-scene::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 42%,rgba(12,24,18,.78) 100%); }
  .be-visual-scene figcaption { position:absolute; z-index:1; left:26px; right:24px; bottom:24px; color:#fff; }
  .be-visual-scene figcaption span { display:block; margin-bottom:7px; color:#e5ca92; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .be-visual-scene figcaption strong { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:25px; line-height:1.15; font-weight:500; }
  .be-atlas { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(280px,.45fr); min-height:500px; margin-bottom:32px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:28px; background:#1d342a; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(24,33,28,.09); }
  .be-atlas-map { position:relative; min-height:500px; isolation:isolate; overflow:hidden; background:radial-gradient(circle at 28% 24%,rgba(191,161,105,.13),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(145deg,#294538,#172a22); }
  .be-atlas-map::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:-1; background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 49.8%,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 50% 50.2%,transparent 50.2%),linear-gradient(0deg,transparent 0 49.8%,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 50% 50.2%,transparent 50.2%); background-size:112px 112px; }
  .be-atlas-lines { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; pointer-events:none; }
  .be-atlas-route { fill:none; stroke:#d7bd87; stroke-width:2.3; stroke-dasharray:5 8; opacity:.82; }
  .be-atlas-contour { fill:none; stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.1); stroke-width:1; }
  .be-atlas-pin { position:absolute; z-index:2; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; color:#fff; text-decoration:none; transform:translate(-15px,-50%); }
  .be-atlas-pin::before { content:""; flex:0 0 auto; width:13px; height:13px; border:5px solid #d7bd87; border-radius:50%; background:#1d342a; box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(215,189,135,.13); transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .be-atlas-pin:hover::before,.be-atlas-pin:focus-visible::before { transform:scale(1.15); box-shadow:0 0 0 10px rgba(215,189,135,.16); }
  .be-atlas-pin span { display:block; padding:10px 13px 9px; background:rgba(15,28,22,.78); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius:12px; backdrop-filter:blur(8px); }
  .be-atlas-pin strong { display:block; font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:22px; line-height:1.1; font-weight:500; }
  .be-atlas-pin small { display:block; margin-top:4px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.58); font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .be-atlas-pin--shangri-la { left:29%; top:25%; }
  .be-atlas-pin--dali { left:40%; top:66%; }
  .be-atlas-pin--guizhou { left:76%; top:70%; }
  .be-atlas-aside { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; padding:46px 38px 38px; background:#e9e0ce; color:var(--be-forest); }
  .be-atlas-index { font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; color:#967744; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .be-atlas-aside h3 { margin:28px 0 20px; font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:35px; line-height:1.08; font-weight:500; }
  .be-atlas-aside p { font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; color:#566259; }
  .be-atlas-legend { margin-top:36px; padding-top:22px; border-top:1px solid rgba(35,59,48,.18); color:#7a817b; font-size:10px; line-height:1.6; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .be-region-stack { display:grid; gap:30px; }
  .be-region { display:grid; grid-template-columns:220px 1fr; overflow:hidden; background:#fff; border:0; border-radius:24px; box-shadow:0 16px 46px rgba(24,33,28,.06); scroll-margin-top:90px; }
  .be-region-side { background:var(--be-forest); color:#fff; padding:36px 30px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; }
  .be-region-side h3 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:34px; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:9px; }
  .be-region-side p { font-size:12px; line-height:1.55; color:rgba(255,255,255,.65); }
  .be-region-side a { margin-top:36px; color:#e3c78f; font-size:12px; text-decoration:none; }
  .be-region-main { padding:34px 38px 38px; }
  .be-region-main > p { max-width:800px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.85; color:#59635c; }
  .be-lodge-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; margin-top:28px; }
  .be-lodge { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; background:var(--be-paper); border-radius:15px; }
  .be-lodge-media { height:150px; overflow:hidden; background:#d8d5ca; }
  .be-lodge-media picture,.be-lodge-media img { width:100%; height:100%; display:block; }
  .be-lodge-media img { object-fit:cover; transition:transform .45s ease; }
  .be-lodge:hover img { transform:scale(1.035); }
  .be-lodge-copy { padding:17px 18px 19px; }
  .be-lodge-copy h4 { font-size:15px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:5px; color:var(--be-forest); }
  .be-lodge-copy p { color:#717b73; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; }
  .be-route-groups { display:grid; gap:62px; }
  .be-route-group-head { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .be-route-group-head h3 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; color:var(--be-forest); font-size:31px; font-weight:500; }
  .be-route-group-head span { font-size:12px; color:#8a918b; }
  .be-route-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px; }
  .be-route-card { display:grid; grid-template-columns:190px 1fr; min-height:196px; background:#fff; border:0; border-radius:18px; text-decoration:none; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(24,33,28,.055); transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease; }
  .be-route-card:hover { transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(24,33,28,.09); }
  .be-route-image { min-height:196px; overflow:hidden; background:#d8d5ca; }
  .be-route-image picture,.be-route-image img { width:100%; height:100%; display:block; }
  .be-route-image img { object-fit:cover; transition:transform .45s ease; }
  .be-route-card:hover img { transform:scale(1.04); }
  .be-route-copy { padding:25px 24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
  .be-route-meta { color:#8a7143; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:11px; }
  .be-route-copy h4 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:20px; line-height:1.3; font-weight:500; color:var(--be-forest); margin-bottom:10px; }
  .be-route-copy p { font-size:12px; line-height:1.55; color:#747d76; }
  .be-route-arrow { margin-top:auto; padding-top:15px; color:#8a7143; font-size:12px; }
  .be-plan { background:var(--be-forest); color:#fff; }
  .be-plan .be-section { padding-top:88px; padding-bottom:88px; }
  .be-plan .be-section-head { margin-bottom:44px; }
  .be-plan .be-kicker { color:#e0c48c; }
  .be-plan h2 { color:#fff; }
  .be-plan .be-lead { color:rgba(255,255,255,.68); }
  .be-steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); }
  .be-step { padding:38px 34px 12px 0; }
  .be-step + .be-step { border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); padding-left:34px; }
  .be-step span { color:#dfc186; font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:18px; }
  .be-step h3 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:24px; font-weight:500; margin:22px 0 13px; }
  .be-step p { color:rgba(255,255,255,.66); font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; }
  .be-faq-list { border-top:1px solid var(--be-line); }
  .be-faq { border-bottom:1px solid var(--be-line); }
  .be-faq summary { list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:25px 45px 25px 0; position:relative; font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:21px; color:var(--be-forest); }
  .be-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
  .be-faq summary::after { content:"+"; position:absolute; right:4px; top:22px; color:#9b7d46; font:300 26px/1 sans-serif; }
  .be-faq[open] summary::after { content:"−"; }
  .be-faq p { max-width:820px; padding:0 0 27px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; color:#5b655e; }
  .be-cta { width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 48px)); margin:0 auto; padding:0 0 96px; }
  .be-cta-inner { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:36px; align-items:center; overflow:hidden; border-radius:24px; background:#e9e0ce; padding:52px 58px; }
  .be-cta h2 { font-family:'Playfair Display','Noto Sans SC',serif; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px); line-height:1.1; font-weight:500; color:var(--be-forest); margin-bottom:13px; }
  .be-cta p { max-width:650px; color:#5e675f; font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; }
  .be-cta a { background:var(--be-forest); color:#fff; padding:16px 24px; min-width:190px; border-radius:999px; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.04em; transition:background .2s ease; }
  .be-cta a:hover { background:#172b22; }
  @media (max-width:900px) {
    .be-section-head { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
    .be-fit-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .be-fit-card { min-height:0; }
    .be-visual-story { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .be-visual-scene { min-height:390px; }
    .be-visual-scene:nth-child(2) { margin-top:0; }
    .be-visual-scene:last-child { grid-column:1 / -1; min-height:360px; }
    .be-atlas { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(260px,.65fr); }
    .be-region { grid-template-columns:180px 1fr; }
    .be-lodge-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .be-route-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width:620px) {
    .be-hero { min-height:640px; border-radius:0 0 24px 24px; }
    .be-hero-inner,.be-section,.be-cta { width:calc(100% - 32px); }
    .be-hero-inner { padding:100px 0 48px; }
    .be-breadcrumb { margin-bottom:38px; }
    .be-hero h1 { font-size:51px; }
    .be-hero-deck { font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; }
    .be-stat-row { margin-top:30px; }
    .be-stat { min-width:calc(50% - 1px); padding:13px 14px; }
    .be-section { padding:64px 0; }
    .be-section-head { margin-bottom:36px; }
    .be-lead { font-size:16px; line-height:1.8; }
    .be-fit-card { padding:28px 25px; }
    .be-fit-card::before { left:25px; }
    .be-fit-card .be-num { margin-bottom:24px; }
    .be-visual-story { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; margin-top:40px; }
    .be-visual-scene,.be-visual-scene:last-child { grid-column:auto; min-height:330px; border-radius:19px; }
    .be-visual-scene:nth-child(2) { margin-top:0; }
    .be-visual-scene figcaption { left:21px; right:20px; bottom:20px; }
    .be-visual-scene figcaption strong { font-size:22px; }
    .be-atlas { grid-template-columns:1fr; min-height:0; }
    .be-atlas-map { min-height:410px; }
    .be-atlas-aside { padding:30px 26px; }
    .be-atlas-aside h3 { margin:18px 0 13px; font-size:28px; }
    .be-atlas-legend { margin-top:20px; padding-top:16px; }
    .be-atlas-pin { gap:7px; transform:translate(-10px,-50%); }
    .be-atlas-pin::before { width:10px; height:10px; border-width:4px; }
    .be-atlas-pin span { padding:8px 10px 7px; }
    .be-atlas-pin strong { font-size:17px; }
    .be-atlas-pin small { font-size:8px; }
    .be-atlas-pin--shangri-la { left:24%; top:24%; }
    .be-atlas-pin--dali { left:32%; top:63%; }
    .be-atlas-pin--guizhou { left:auto; right:18px; top:76%; transform:translateY(-50%); flex-direction:row-reverse; }
    html[lang="en"] .be-hero h1 { font-size:44px; }
    .be-region { grid-template-columns:1fr; border-radius:20px; }
    .be-region-side { padding:28px 26px; }
    .be-region-side a { margin-top:22px; }
    .be-region-main { padding:27px 22px 30px; }
    .be-lodge-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .be-lodge { display:grid; grid-template-columns:120px 1fr; border-radius:13px; }
    .be-lodge-media { height:112px; }
    .be-route-groups { gap:48px; }
    .be-route-group-head { align-items:flex-end; }
    .be-route-card { grid-template-columns:112px 1fr; min-height:180px; border-radius:15px; }
    .be-route-image { min-height:180px; }
    .be-route-copy { padding:20px 17px; }
    .be-route-copy h4 { font-size:17px; }
    .be-route-copy p { display:none; }
    .be-plan .be-section { padding-top:64px; padding-bottom:64px; }
    .be-steps { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .be-step { padding:28px 0; }
    .be-step + .be-step { border-left:0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); padding-left:0; }
    .be-faq summary { font-size:18px; line-height:1.45; }
    .be-cta { padding-bottom:64px; }
    .be-cta-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:38px 28px; }
    .be-cta a { width:100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
    .be-visual-scene img,.be-lodge img,.be-route-card,.be-route-image img,.be-atlas-pin::before { transition:none; }
    .be-visual-scene:hover img,.be-lodge:hover img,.be-route-card:hover,.be-route-card:hover .be-route-image img,.be-atlas-pin:hover::before,.be-atlas-pin:focus-visible::before { transform:none; }
  }
</style>

<% const isEn = lang === 'en';
   const prefix = isEn ? '/en' : '';
   const heroLodge = lodges.find(function(l) { return l.hero_path === editorialHero; }) || lodges[0];
   const visualScenes = [
     { slug:'cunxiao', region_zh:'贵州', region_en:'Guizhou', title_zh:'住进山野与村落', title_en:'Villages held by the mountains' },
     { slug:'miwan', region_zh:'大理', region_en:'Dali', title_zh:'把时间留在洱海', title_en:'Time held at Erhai' },
     { slug:'saiduo', region_zh:'香格里拉', region_en:'Shangri-La', title_zh:'循着牧场走向高原', title_en:'From pasture into the plateau' }
   ].map(function(scene) { return { ...scene, lodge:lodges.find(function(l) { return l.slug === scene.slug; }) }; }).filter(function(scene) { return scene.lodge; }); %>
<main class="be-page">
  <header class="be-hero">
    <div class="be-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="<%= cdnImage(heroLodge.hero_path.replace(/\.(jpg|jpeg|png)$/i, '.webp'), 1600) %>" type="image/webp">
        <img src="<%= cdnImage(heroLodge.hero_path, 1600) %>" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
      </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="be-hero-inner">
      <nav class="be-breadcrumb" aria-label="<%= isEn ? 'Breadcrumb' : '面包屑导航' %>">
        <a href="<%= prefix || '/' %>"><%= isEn ? 'Home' : '首页' %></a><span>/</span>
        <a href="<%= prefix %>/brands"><%= isEn ? 'Brands' : '品牌' %></a><span>/</span>
        <span><%= isEn ? brand.name_en : brand.name_zh %></span>
      </nav>
      <p class="be-eyebrow"><%= isEn ? editorial.eyebrow_en : editorial.eyebrow_zh %></p>
      <h1><%= isEn ? 'Jianglu in Southwest China' : '匠庐 · 中国西南' %></h1>
      <p class="be-hero-deck"><%= isEn ? editorial.intro_en : editorial.intro_zh %></p>
      <div class="be-stat-row" aria-label="<%= isEn ? 'Collection overview' : '收录概览' %>">
        <div class="be-stat"><strong><%= lodges.length %></strong><span><%= isEn ? 'indexed stays' : '家住宿索引' %></span></div>
        <div class="be-stat"><strong><%= routes.length %></strong><span><%= isEn ? 'curated routes' : '条甄选线路' %></span></div>
        <div class="be-stat"><strong><%= editorial.regions.length %></strong><span><%= isEn ? 'travel clusters' : '个旅行分区' %></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="be-section" aria-labelledby="be-fit-title">
    <div class="be-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="be-kicker"><%= isEn ? 'Traveller fit' : '适合谁' %></p>
        <h2 id="be-fit-title"><%= isEn ? 'A stay-led way into place' : '从一间住宿，进入一个地方' %></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="be-lead"><%= isEn ? brand.body_en : brand.body_zh %></p>
        <div class="be-context-links">
          <a href="<%= prefix %>/destinations/china"><%= isEn ? 'Explore China inbound' : '查看中国入境旅行' %></a>
          <a href="<%= prefix %>/guides/first-trip-to-china"><%= isEn ? 'First trip to China' : '第一次去中国指南' %></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="be-fit-grid">
      <% editorial.fit.forEach(function(item, index) { %>
      <article class="be-fit-card">
        <div class="be-num">0<%= index + 1 %></div>
        <h3><%= isEn ? item.title_en : item.title_zh %></h3>
        <p><%= isEn ? item.body_en : item.body_zh %></p>
      </article>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <div class="be-visual-story" role="group" aria-label="<%= isEn ? 'Jianglu landscapes across three regions' : '匠庐三地风景' %>">
      <% visualScenes.forEach(function(scene) { %>
      <figure class="be-visual-scene">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="<%= cdnImage(scene.lodge.hero_path.replace(/\.(jpg|jpeg|png)$/i, '.webp'), 1000) %>" type="image/webp">
          <img src="<%= cdnImage(scene.lodge.hero_path, 1000) %>" alt="<%= isEn ? scene.lodge.name_en : scene.lodge.name_zh %>" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </picture>
        <figcaption><span><%= isEn ? scene.region_en : scene.region_zh %></span><strong><%= isEn ? scene.title_en : scene.title_zh %></strong></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="be-section" aria-labelledby="be-regions-title">
    <div class="be-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="be-kicker"><%= isEn ? 'Stay index by region' : '按地域找住宿' %></p>
        <h2 id="be-regions-title"><%= isEn ? 'Three clusters, three different rhythms' : '三个分区，三种旅行节奏' %></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="be-lead"><%= isEn ? 'The current collection is organised around Guizhou, Dali and Shangri-La, with each cluster balancing stays, landscapes and realistic transfer time differently.' : '当前收录按贵州、大理与香格里拉组织；每个分区都以不同方式平衡住宿、山水与实际转场时间。' %></p>
    </div>
    <nav class="be-atlas" aria-label="<%= isEn ? 'Jianglu travel clusters map' : '匠庐旅行分区地图' %>">
      <div class="be-atlas-map">
        <svg class="be-atlas-lines" viewBox="0 0 820 500" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path class="be-atlas-contour" d="M-35 137C85 60 198 54 283 113s177 57 255 3 190-30 305 60"/>
          <path class="be-atlas-contour" d="M-17 182c121-68 221-57 301 9s165 68 258 8 196-36 303 25"/>
          <path class="be-atlas-contour" d="M-26 407c108-88 225-95 330-42s176 47 258 4 181-31 284 17"/>
          <path class="be-atlas-contour" d="M39 456c91-65 184-67 274-27s169 37 255 0 168-25 245 7"/>
          <path class="be-atlas-route" d="M238 126C258 210 291 269 328 330C415 346 519 350 623 350"/>
        </svg>
        <% editorial.regions.forEach(function(region) {
             const regionLodges = lodges.filter(function(lodge) { return lodge.cluster === region.key; }); %>
        <a class="be-atlas-pin be-atlas-pin--<%= region.key %>" href="#region-<%= region.key %>">
          <span><strong><%= isEn ? region.name_en : region.name_zh %></strong><small><%= regionLodges.length %> <%= isEn ? 'stays' : '家住宿' %></small></span>
        </a>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
      <div class="be-atlas-aside">
        <div>
          <div class="be-atlas-index">01 — 03</div>
          <h3><%= isEn ? 'A southwest lodge atlas' : '一张西南住宿地图' %></h3>
          <p><%= isEn ? 'Guizhou spreads across villages and highland roads. Dali slows the journey at Erhai. Shangri-La climbs gradually from pasture towards Meili. Choose a point to explore its stays and routes.' : '贵州沿村寨与高地公路展开，大理把节奏停在洱海，香格里拉则从牧场逐级走向梅里。选择一个地点，查看对应住宿与线路。' %></p>
        </div>
        <div class="be-atlas-legend"><%= isEn ? 'Schematic travel relationship · not to scale' : '旅行关系示意 · 非精确比例地图' %></div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div class="be-region-stack">
      <% editorial.regions.forEach(function(region) {
           const regionLodges = lodges.filter(function(lodge) { return lodge.cluster === region.key; }); %>
      <article class="be-region" id="region-<%= region.key %>">
        <div class="be-region-side">
          <div>
            <h3><%= isEn ? region.name_en : region.name_zh %></h3>
            <p><%= isEn ? region.label_en : region.label_zh %></p>
          </div>
          <a href="<%= prefix + region.destination %>"><%= isEn ? 'Region guide →' : '查看地域指南 →' %></a>
        </div>
        <div class="be-region-main">
          <p><%= isEn ? region.body_en : region.body_zh %></p>
          <div class="be-lodge-grid">
            <% regionLodges.forEach(function(lodge) { %>
            <article class="be-lodge">
              <div class="be-lodge-media">
                <picture>
                  <source srcset="<%= cdnImage(lodge.hero_path.replace(/\.(jpg|jpeg|png)$/i, '.webp'), 800) %>" type="image/webp">
                  <img src="<%= cdnImage(lodge.hero_path, 800) %>" alt="<%= isEn ? lodge.name_en : lodge.name_zh %>" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                </picture>
              </div>
              <div class="be-lodge-copy">
                <h4><%= isEn ? lodge.name_en : lodge.name_zh %></h4>
                <p><%= isEn ? lodge.tagline_en : lodge.tagline_zh %></p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <% }); %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="be-section" aria-labelledby="be-routes-title">
    <div class="be-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="be-kicker"><%= isEn ? 'Curated route index' : '线路索引' %></p>
        <h2 id="be-routes-title"><%= isEn ? 'Nine starting points, not fixed packages' : '9 条起点，不是 9 个固定套餐' %></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="be-lead"><%= isEn ? 'Open a route for the full daily rhythm, lodge sequence and transfer logic. We can shorten, deepen or combine it after a human conversation.' : '打开线路可查看每日节奏、住宿顺序与转场逻辑。真人顾问会在沟通后删减、加深或重新组合，而不是直接套用。' %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="be-route-groups">
      <% editorial.regions.forEach(function(region) {
           const regionRoutes = routes.filter(function(route) { return (isEn ? route.region_en : route.region_zh) === (isEn ? region.name_en : region.name_zh); }); %>
      <div class="be-route-group">
        <div class="be-route-group-head">
          <h3><%= isEn ? region.name_en : region.name_zh %></h3>
          <span><%= regionRoutes.length %> <%= isEn ? 'routes' : '条线路' %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="be-route-grid">
          <% regionRoutes.forEach(function(route) { %>
          <a class="be-route-card" href="<%= prefix %>/routes/<%= route.slug %>">
            <div class="be-route-image">
              <picture>
                <source srcset="<%= cdnImage(route.hero_path.replace(/\.jpg$/i, '.webp'), 800) %>" type="image/webp">
                <img src="<%= cdnImage(route.hero_path, 800) %>" alt="<%= isEn ? route.title_en : route.title_zh %>" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </picture>
            </div>
            <div class="be-route-copy">
              <div class="be-route-meta"><%= isEn ? route.duration_en : route.duration_zh %> · <%= isEn ? region.name_en : region.name_zh %></div>
              <h4><%= isEn ? route.title_en : route.title_zh %></h4>
              <p><%= isEn ? route.subtitle_en : route.subtitle_zh %></p>
              <span class="be-route-arrow"><%= isEn ? 'View journey →' : '查看行程 →' %></span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="be-plan">
    <section class="be-section" aria-labelledby="be-plan-title">
      <div class="be-section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="be-kicker"><%= isEn ? 'How we combine the journey' : '如何组合旅行' %></p>
          <h2 id="be-plan-title"><%= isEn ? 'Start with rhythm, then choose rooms' : '先定节奏，再选房间' %></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="be-lead"><%= isEn ? 'AI helps the WR team organise options and coordinate faster. A real advisor listens, judges the trade-offs and stays responsible from the first conversation through your return.' : 'AI 帮助 WR 团队更快整理选择与协调信息；真正倾听、判断取舍，并从第一次沟通负责到旅行归来的，始终是真人顾问。' %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="be-steps">
        <% editorial.planning.forEach(function(step, index) { %>
        <article class="be-step"><span>0<%= index + 1 %></span><h3><%= isEn ? step.title_en : step.title_zh %></h3><p><%= isEn ? step.body_en : step.body_zh %></p></article>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="be-section" aria-labelledby="be-faq-title">
    <div class="be-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="be-kicker"><%= isEn ? 'Frequently asked questions' : '常见问题' %></p>
        <h2 id="be-faq-title"><%= isEn ? 'Before choosing a Jianglu route' : '选择匠庐线路之前' %></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="be-lead"><%= isEn ? 'The answers below clarify how the page works and where route judgement matters. Availability and final arrangements are confirmed case by case.' : '以下回答说明本页的使用方式与需要人工判断的环节。实际房态与最终安排均按具体日期逐一确认。' %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="be-faq-list">
      <% editorial.faq.forEach(function(item, index) { %>
      <details class="be-faq"<%= index === 0 ? ' open' : '' %>><summary><%= isEn ? item.q_en : item.q_zh %></summary><p><%= isEn ? item.a_en : item.a_zh %></p></details>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="be-cta" aria-label="<%= isEn ? 'Talk to a travel advisor' : '咨询旅行顾问' %>">
    <div class="be-cta-inner">
      <div><h2><%= isEn ? 'Shape a Jianglu journey around your pace' : '按你的节奏，组合一段匠庐旅行' %></h2><p><%= isEn ? 'Tell us who is travelling, your dates and the landscapes you want to spend time in. A human advisor will reply with a considered first direction.' : '告诉我们同行者、日期和想停留的山水。真人顾问会先回复一版有判断的方向，再继续细化。' %></p></div>
      <a href="<%= advisorUrl(lang, { source: 'jianglu-brand' }) %>" data-enquiry-cta="jianglu-brand"><%= isEn ? 'Talk to an advisor →' : '与顾问聊聊 →' %></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
